Sebastian Rahtz <spqr@minster.york.ac.uk> has volunteered to serve as
coordinator for the "Research on figures and captions" task in the LaTeX3
project.  Accordingly, the master volunteer task list (vol-task.tex) has
been updated to version 2.4a and is available for anonymous ftp retrieval
from:
 [VMS]  Niord.SHSU.edu:[FILESERV.VOL-TASK]VOL-TASK.TEX
and
 [Unix] pip.SHSU.edu:/vol-task.tex
or by including:
 SENDME VOL-TASK
in the body of a mail message to FILESERV@SHSU[.BITNET|.edu]

To known and listed coordinators:
If any volunteers contact you directly regarding service in your area, I
would appreciate notification (by either you or them) of their name and
network address (if any) so I may update the master volunteer task list
file accordingly.

If I may assist you in any manner, please contact me directly.

Regards,   George
